1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/qa/qa-traditional-backend-to-ai-engineer","children":["Q&A丨AI 视角下的后端技术重塑"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/qa-traditional-backend-to-ai-engineer.jpg","alt":"Q&A丨AI 视角下的后端技术重塑 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"ai问答"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"Q&A丨AI 视角下的后端技术重塑"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文跟 Gemini 探讨在 AI 时代下，传统后端工程师如何结合自身优势，转型为 AI 应用开发工程师。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-09-05T17:13:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/09/05"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","13,227"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["现在（2025.9），AI 技术突飞猛进，既是机会，也是压力。作为一名传统后端工程师（Go/Rust），笔者一直在想：",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"如何顺势完成从后端开发到 AI 应用开发的转型？"}]]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["在摸索这条路的过程中，焦虑常常多于笃定。AI 框架、AI Agent 应用、新技术、新工具层出不穷，标题一个比一个猛——",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"\"它终于来了 xxx\""}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"\"👋🏻 再见 xxx\""}],"、",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"\"史上最强 xxx\""}],"……"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["为了把焦虑变成路径，笔者决定和 Gemini 来一场更系统的探讨：",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"不空谈宏论，而是请它在后端工程师日常用到的技术上补上一层\"AI 视角\"，用一条从已知走向未知的学习路线把问题说清楚。"}]]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"具体来说，笔者希望 Gemini 围绕 Go/Rust、MySQL/Redis/Kafka，以及《DDIA（设计数据密集型应用）》和《亿级流量系统架构设计与实战》这两本书展开，为这些熟悉的主题都加上一个\"AI 视角\"。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"废话不多说，接下来我们来看看 Gemini 给出的答卷吧~"}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"术","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#术","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#术"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"术","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":4,"offset":448},"end":{"line":13,"column":5,"offset":449}}}]},"children":"术"}]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"一ai-时代的基础架构转变","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#一ai-时代的基础架构转变","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#一ai-时代的基础架构转变"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一、AI 时代的基础架构转变","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":5,"offset":455},"end":{"line":15,"column":19,"offset":469}}}]},"children":"一、AI 时代的基础架构转变"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"人工智能（AI）的发展并非要取代经典的后端工程原则，而是要求我们对其进行演进。我们将深入剖析从确定性的、低延迟的 Web 服务到概率性的、高延迟的、有状态系统的根本性转变。这一转变是理解和构建下一代 AI 原生应用的基础。"}],"\n",["$","h4","h4-0",{"id":"11-从同步请求响应到异步任务编排","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#11-从同步请求响应到异步任务编排","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#11-从同步请求响应到异步任务编排"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.1 从同步请求/响应到异步任务编排","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":6,"offset":589},"end":{"line":19,"column":25,"offset":608}}}]},"children":"1.1 从同步请求/响应到异步任务编排"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":"传统的后端架构建立在同步请求/响应模型之上，客户端发起一个 HTTP 请求，并阻塞等待服务器在几百毫秒内返回结果。然而，大型语言模型（LLM）的引入彻底颠覆了这一范式。一次 LLM 调用可能需要数秒甚至数分钟才能完成，这在传统同步模型中是不可接受的。因此，架构的核心必须转向异步任务编排。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-7",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250905183444729.png","alt":"","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250905183444729.png","alt":""},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":756},"end":{"line":23,"column":84,"offset":839}}}}]}],"\n",["$","h5","h5-0",{"id":"任务队列架构","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#任务队列架构","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#任务队列架构"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"任务队列架构","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":7,"offset":847},"end":{"line":25,"column":13,"offset":853}}}]},"children":"任务队列架构"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-8",{"children":"任务队列架构（Task Queue Architecture）是应对高延迟挑战的首要模式。它将耗时的操作与即时响应解耦，从而保证了用户体验的流畅性。其标准流程如下："}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69","\n","$L6a","\n","$L6b","\n","$L6c","\n","$L6d","\n","$L6e","\n","$L6f","\n","$L70","\n","$L71","\n","$L72","\n","$L73","\n","$L74","\n","$L75","\n","$L76","\n","$L77","\n","$L78","\n","$L79","\n","$L7a","\n","$L7b","\n","$L7c","\n","$L7d","\n","$L7e","\n","$L7f","\n","$L80","\n","$L81","\n","$L82","\n","$L83","\n","$L84","\n","$L85","\n","$L86","\n","$L87","\n","$L88","\n","$L89","\n","$L8a","\n","$L8b","\n","$L8c","\n","$L8d","\n","$L8e","\n","$L8f","\n","$L90","\n","$L91","\n","$L92","\n","$L93","\n","$L94","\n","$L95","\n","$L96","\n","$L97"]}]}],"$L98","$L99","$L9a"]}],"$L9b"]}]]}]}]
